id: pm-jira-create-field-previews
title: Preview required Jira create fields before export
description: "Explicit project and issue type create-contract adaptation with typed SDK and CLI, bounded output, actionable refusals, SDK-backed no-git validation and CI npm/Bun release evidence."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-25T23:12:19.246Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-25T23:33:48.169Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: Custom required fields and allowed values validated against revisioned metadata fixtures; Missing answers produce zero POSTs; Diagnostics fit declared byte budget or expose continuation
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-25T23:12:21.477Z",codex-agent,"Overlap check: searched core CLI and pm-jira, pm-linear and pm-github source/docs for createmeta, create-contract and completion previews. Existing Jira transition planning adapts existing-issue transitions only; core schemas describe pm fields. No duplicate create-contract implementation found. Plan: strict revisioned normalized fixture, pure typed compiler, SDK command registration/rendering, optional all-batch export guard, byte-budget continuation, no-git SDK state validation. No new journal or shared mutable state."
  "2026-10-25T23:21:41.223Z",codex-agent,"Implemented strict v1 metadata/answer compiler, typed result/remedy envelopes, SDK-registered preview-create command and opt-in all-create-batch export guard. Targeted tests prove missing answers and a later invalid item cause zero POST/PUT calls. Installed CLI passes JSON/TOON in a real non-git tracker with git absent from PATH. Both new modules measured 100% lines/branches/functions in targeted coverage. Seeded SDK reference-model validation is expanding across direct import, sync, native importer and config importer with replayed older inputs and CRLF/native relationships. No new shared mutable state or journal is introduced."
  "2026-10-25T23:25:40.322Z",codex-agent,"Revert proof: disabling only required-field handling in previewJiraCreate makes the targeted revisioned-field test fail (0 pass / 1 fail); disabling only the runExportPush contract guard makes its batch-validation test fail (0 pass / 1 fail). Both functions restored, rebuilt, and the linked pm test run passes all 11 targeted tests. Typecheck, test typecheck, docstring gate (15 files / 76 declarations) and diff whitespace check pass. Seed 0x4a495241 passes 500 sequences / 2000 operations across direct import, sync and both importer adapters, including 40 exact SDK journal-plan refusals with state unchanged. Follow-up pm-jira-atomic-replay-revisions and existing diagnostic item pm-jira-d3tp record that separate limitation."
  "2026-10-25T23:27:22.737Z",codex-agent,"Real-data validation: public unbraind/pm-jira origin/main 84d1cde6211d9330ed659c39a756259e58c2f9c8 copied into a non-git scratch project with 225 source files read-only. Certified SDK reads: 109 items (6 open, 1 in progress, 101 closed, 1 canceled). Revisioned synthetic Team fixture: 109 missing checklists, 109 ready bindings with allowed answer, 109 invalid-choice results; maximum JSON 967 / 4096 bytes. Guarded full batch: 0 POST / 0 PUT. All 225 source-file hashes unchanged; disposable SDK runtime caches excluded. Docs record scope and reproduction inputs. Added escaped-Unicode budget refusal to prevent nonadvancing continuation when a single row cannot fit."
  "2026-10-25T23:28:58.435Z",codex-agent,"Final output accounting includes two-space JSON indentation plus newline: public-corpus maximum is 1260 pretty JSON bytes (967 compact bytes) under 4096. Installed CLI tests also exercise bounded multi-page JSON and TOON. Targeted suite now has 12 tests plus the 500-sequence model test; input/output extreme-value fuzz runs 1000 seeded cases. A peer mutation injected between POST awaits cannot change the already-validated create payload snapshot. No separate lint script is configured; typecheck, test typecheck, docstring gate and git diff --check are the local static checks. Full npm and Bun release gates will run on CI at unchanged thresholds."
  "2026-10-25T23:33:48.168Z",codex-agent,"First CI run 40245077348 measured 100% lines/branches/functions across all six measured modules, but failed one model test because its reference hard-coded the local SDK harness author; CI resolves a different SDK default. Replaced that assumption with the same native SDK author default in the independent reference tracker, while retaining the explicit atomic importer author. Same-tracker replay comparisons now include all timestamps; only cross-tracker comparisons exclude independent clocks. DeepScan identified a test array used only for its length; pagination now asserts actual missing-field identities, choice identities and every bound value. Existing Hound ES5 parser diagnostics remain tracked by pm-jira-92cf."
